# Muslim-ruled polities that Wikidata does not tag with religion Islam (P140), so q09 misses them. QIDs found by exact English label and checked as historical country, dynasty, empire, kingdom or caliphate on 2026-10-12. Add more here by hand, never by guessing a QID. Known gap: the Mamluk Sultanate of Cairo (the label "Mamluk Sultanate" resolves to the Delhi dynasty Q847420); find its QID by hand.
SELECT DISTINCT ?item WHERE { VALUES ?item { wd:Q33296 wd:Q171740 wd:Q431575 wd:Q207600 wd:Q184536 wd:Q202687 wd:Q266923 wd:Q2365048 wd:Q276951 wd:Q975405 wd:Q837187 wd:Q3175929 wd:Q1061057 wd:Q157904 wd:Q1474791 wd:Q861784 wd:Q161205 wd:Q555994 wd:Q324470 wd:Q600524 } } LIMIT 100
